{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Tiny Little Royale</strong> \ud83c\udf89</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of chaotic, funny, and action-packed battles! <strong>Tiny Little Royale</strong> is a 2.5D top-down multiplayer shooter that mixes casual fun with mid-core intensity. Easy to learn but challenging to master, every match is full of surprises, strategy, and laughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/extras/994d0c973fa1b56989361fa720ff45d1.avif?t=1759542338\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch \u2013 Survival</strong> \ud83e\ude96<br>Go solo! Outlast everyone and prove you\u2019re the ultimate survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flag Frenzy \u2013 Capture the Flag</strong> \ud83d\udea9<br>Steal the enemy\u2019s flag and bring it home\u2014teamwork and quick moves are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena \u2013 Team vs Team</strong> \u2694\ufe0f<br>Form your squad and face off against rivals in epic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/extras/82a2bdfacd7bd73b8a3fc26d84a506eb.avif?t=1759542338\" width=1280 height=591 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2b Weapons &amp; Cosmetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with a collection of <strong>unique and hilarious weapons</strong>, inspired by ASEAN culture and everyday fun:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slapper</strong> \u2013 Smack down foes with an oversized sandal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mosquito Shock</strong> \u2013 Zap enemies with a high-voltage mosquito swatter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Durian Bomb</strong> \u2013 Toss the spiky fruit and watch chaos (and stink) unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Launcher</strong> \u2013 Fire a flapping chicken that clucks all the way to impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water Gun</strong> \u2013 Spray down rivals with colorful streams of water.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/extras/9e6ba94335aeb4a966d19f5a05d69992.avif?t=1759542338\" width=960 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it\u2019s not just weapons\u2014customize your fighter with <strong>cute and fun costumes</strong> \ud83c\udfad. From quirky outfits to silly headgear, mix and match to show off your style while you battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, fun matches</strong> \u2013 No long waits. Jump in, blast away, and laugh out loud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual but competitive</strong> \u2013 Easy controls, but skill and tactics make the difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional flavor</strong> \u2013 Humor and weapons inspired by real ASEAN culture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always something new</strong> \u2013 Seasonal updates and rotating events keep the chaos going.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Little Royale</strong> isn\u2019t just about winning\u2014it\u2019s about surviving the madness, pulling off ridiculous plays, and having a blast with friends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059520?t=1759542338","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059520?t=1759542338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/99bc2da7c3a0c3613cc72c11d160479793736634/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759542338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/99bc2da7c3a0c3613cc72c11d160479793736634/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759542338","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Tiny Little Royale</strong> \ud83c\udf89</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of chaotic, funny, and action-packed battles! <strong>Tiny Little Royale</strong> is a 2.5D top-down multiplayer shooter that mixes casual fun with mid-core intensity. Easy to learn but challenging to master, every match is full of surprises, strategy, and laughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/extras/994d0c973fa1b56989361fa720ff45d1.avif?t=1759542338\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deathmatch \u2013 Survival</strong> \ud83e\ude96<br>Go solo! Outlast everyone and prove you\u2019re the ultimate survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flag Frenzy \u2013 Capture the Flag</strong> \ud83d\udea9<br>Steal the enemy\u2019s flag and bring it home\u2014teamwork and quick moves are key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena \u2013 Team vs Team</strong> \u2694\ufe0f<br>Form your squad and face off against rivals in epic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/extras/82a2bdfacd7bd73b8a3fc26d84a506eb.avif?t=1759542338\" width=1280 height=591 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2b Weapons &amp; Cosmetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with a collection of <strong>unique and hilarious weapons</strong>, inspired by ASEAN culture and everyday fun:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slapper</strong> \u2013 Smack down foes with an oversized sandal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mosquito Shock</strong> \u2013 Zap enemies with a high-voltage mosquito swatter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Durian Bomb</strong> \u2013 Toss the spiky fruit and watch chaos (and stink) unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chicken Launcher</strong> \u2013 Fire a flapping chicken that clucks all the way to impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water Gun</strong> \u2013 Spray down rivals with colorful streams of water.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/extras/9e6ba94335aeb4a966d19f5a05d69992.avif?t=1759542338\" width=960 height=442 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it\u2019s not just weapons\u2014customize your fighter with <strong>cute and fun costumes</strong> \ud83c\udfad. From quirky outfits to silly headgear, mix and match to show off your style while you battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, fun matches</strong> \u2013 No long waits. Jump in, blast away, and laugh out loud.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual but competitive</strong> \u2013 Easy controls, but skill and tactics make the difference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional flavor</strong> \u2013 Humor and weapons inspired by real ASEAN culture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always something new</strong> \u2013 Seasonal updates and rotating events keep the chaos going.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Little Royale</strong> isn\u2019t just about winning\u2014it\u2019s about surviving the madness, pulling off ridiculous plays, and having a blast with friends.</p>","developers":["Hengtech"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059520/2fe8a5c409feba0cd636d5dfe6ae928fe58ea02d/header.jpg?t=1759542338","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059520/857148333/0b4423c5f80fa5fe63745f331abfd576918c890e/1759203327/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759542336","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059520/857148333/0b4423c5f80fa5fe63745f331abfd576918c890e/1759203327/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759542336","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059520/857148333/0b4423c5f80fa5fe63745f331abfd576918c890e/1759203327/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759542336","id":257209027,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209027/movie480.mp4?t=1759542336","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257209027/movie_max.mp4?t=1759542336"},"name":"Tiny little royale trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209027/9720ac46809bce0941d44750c2002cd48d29dfbe/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759542336","webm":{"480":